{"files": [{"id": 37855579, "name": "pbio.3001805.s008.tif", "size": 22797120, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/37855579", "supplied_md5": "686850acee2e7f40ab8f46a18b70238d", "computed_md5": "686850acee2e7f40ab8f46a18b70238d", "mimetype": "image/tiff"}], "folder_structure": {}, "authors": [{"id": 13955914, "full_name": "Jaewon Song", "first_name": "Jaewon", "last_name": "Song", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 10319219, "full_name": "Ryan D. Chow", "first_name": "Ryan D.", "last_name": "Chow", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 14009135, "full_name": "Mario A. Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "first_name": "Mario A.", "last_name": "Pe\u00f1a-Hern\u00e1ndez", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8200, "full_name": "Li Zhang", "first_name": "Li", "last_name": "Zhang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "Li_Zhang", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955920, "full_name": "Skylar A. Loeb", "first_name": "Skylar A.", "last_name": "Loeb", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955923, "full_name": "Eui-Young So", "first_name": "Eui-Young", "last_name": "So", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 13955926, "full_name": "Olin D. Liang", "first_name": "Olin D.", "last_name": "Liang", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 129621, "full_name": "Ping Ren", "first_name": "Ping", "last_name": "Ren", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 127044, "full_name": "Sidi Chen", "first_name": "Sidi", "last_name": "Chen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 8677404, "full_name": "Craig B. Wilen", "first_name": "Craig B.", "last_name": "Wilen", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}, {"id": 179163, "full_name": "Sanghyun Lee", "first_name": "Sanghyun", "last_name": "Lee", "is_active": false, "url_name": "_", "orcid_id": ""}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://plos.figshare.com/articles/figure/LRRC15_expression_in_the_human_lung_is_cell_type_specific_and_inversely_associated_with_ventilator_usage_/21330271", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p>(<b>A</b>, <b>B</b>) Cell type\u2013specific expression of ACE2 and LRRC15, assessed by scRNA-seq of human lungs from (<b>A</b>) the Human Lung Cell Atlas [<a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.ref041\" target=\"_blank\">41</a>] or (<b>B</b>) the Tissue Stability Cell Atlas [<a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.ref042\" target=\"_blank\">42</a>]. (<b>C</b>) Forest plot of the multivariable regression coefficients for various clinical features as predictors for lung expression of LRRC15 (from GTEx; <i>n</i> = 554 samples) [<a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.ref043\" target=\"_blank\">43</a>]. (<b>D</b>) Tukey boxplots (IQR boxes with 1.5 \u00d7 IQR whiskers) showing LRRC15 expression after adjustment for clinical features noted in (<b>C</b>), classifying each lung sample by ventilator status at the time of death. Statistical significance was assessed by two-tailed unpaired Mann\u2013Whitney test. (<b>E</b>) Spearman correlation analysis between LRRC15 and all other genes, based on RNA-seq of human lung samples from GTEx. Multiple hypothesis correction was performed by the Benjamini\u2013Hochberg method. (<b>F</b>) Scatter plot comparing log-normalized expression of LRRC15 and ACE2 across human lung samples. Spearman rho = \u22120.343, <i>p</i> = 2.05 * 10<sup>\u221217</sup>. The linear regression line is overlaid, with 95% confidence intervals shaded in. (<b>G</b>) Cell type\u2013specific expression of genes that are highly correlated with LRRC15, assessed by scRNA-seq of human lungs from the Tissue Stability Cell Atlas. (<b>H</b>) Frequency of LRRC15-expressing fibroblasts and endothelial cells and ACE2-expressing epithelial cells were assessed by scRNA-seq of human lungs and presented in Tukey boxplots (IQR boxes with 1.5 \u00d7 IQR whiskers). For underlying data, see <b><a href=\"http://www.plosbiology.org/article/info:doi/10.1371/journal.pbio.3001805#pbio.3001805.s002\" target=\"_blank\">S2 Data</a></b>. ACE2, angiotensin-converting enzyme 2; GTEx, Genotype-Tissue Expression; IQR, interquartile range; LRRC15, leucin-rich repeat-containing 15; scRNA-seq, single-cell RNA-sequencing.</p> <p>(TIF)</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 1, "status": "public", "size": 22797120, "created_date": "2022-10-13T18:04:44Z", "modified_date": "2023-06-13T06:56:29Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", "lrrc15 </", "trans </", "surface </", "spike protein", "protective role", "primarily detected", "physiological context", "particularly enriched", "moderate affinity", "largely unknown", "extensively studied", "binding domain", ">, suggesting", "19 patients"], "keywords": ["inhibitory attachment factor", "div >< p", "although attachment factors", "regulates viral entry", "coreceptors facilitating entry", "lrrc15 directly binds", "identified human lrrc15", "converting enzyme 2", "human lung single", "2 cellular entry", "mediated viral entry", "entry receptor angiotensin", "lrrc15 inhibits sars", "2 entry", "mediated entry", "inhibits spike", "lrrc15 represents", 